#: ../install.sh:169
msgid ""
"Menu entry: \"Wi-Fi watchdog\" (right-click it for quick actions).\n"
"\n"
"Useful commands:\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog status             status and latest events\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog disconnect         disconnect manually (the watchdog will "
"not reconnect)\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog off                turn the Wi-Fi off until you turn it "
"back on\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog on                 turn on and reconnect\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog gui                open the desktop dialog\n"
"  sudo eduwifi-watchdog test          simulate a hang and verify it "
"recovers\n"
"  journalctl -t eduwifi-watchdog -f   follow the log"
msgstr ""
"Entrée du menu : « Surveillance du Wi-Fi » (clic droit pour les actions "
"rapides).\n"
"\n"
"Commandes utiles :\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog status             état et derniers événements\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog disconnect         déconnecter manuellement (le "
"surveillant ne reconnectera pas)\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog off                éteindre le Wi-Fi jusqu'à ce que vous "
"le rallumiez\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog on                 allumer et reconnecter\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog gui                ouvrir la fenêtre de bureau\n"
"  sudo eduwifi-watchdog test          simuler un blocage et vérifier le "
"rétablissement\n"
"  journalctl -t eduwifi-watchdog -f   suivre le journal"

